@AnalyticOpinion.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7055
# Debe coincidir con ApiSecurity:ApiKey (user-secrets del proyecto API)
@ApiKey = pon-aqui-tu-api-key

### Primera página de comentarios de redes sociales
GET {{AnalyticOpinion.API_HostAddress}}/api/social-comments?page=1&pageSize=100
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Sin API key -> 401
GET {{AnalyticOpinion.API_HostAddress}}/api/social-comments
Accept: application/json

###
